.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt SIMPLEX-CHAT 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm simplex-chat
.Nd SimpleX Chat terminal client
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl d Ar database
.Op Fl e Ar server
.Op Fl h
.Op Fl v
.Nm
.Cm help
.Ar command
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a terminal-based messaging application built on the
SimpleX Chat platform.
It provides end-to-end encrypted messaging without
requiring phone numbers, email addresses, or usernames.
All cryptographic keys are stored exclusively on client
devices.
.Pp
The client connects to SMP servers for message relay
and XFTP servers for file transfers.
Multiple user profiles are supported.
.Pp
The
.Fl d Ar database
option specifies a custom database file path
(default:
.Pa ~/.simplex/simplex_v1 ) .
The
.Fl e Ar server
option specifies a default SMP server to connect to.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa ~/.simplex/
Default directory for user profiles, database files, and
configuration.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr smp-server 1 ,
.Xr xftp-server 1
.Sh STANDARDS
.Rs
.%T SimpleX Chat CLI Guide
.%U https://github.com/simplex-chat/simplex-chat/blob/stable/docs/CLI.md
.Re
.Sh AUTHORS
.An SimpleX Chat contributors
